        {
            "_id": "BA4P5zGjN8184tR2",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Radlight Spores",
            "sort": 600000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "reaction"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The radlight cap takes damage or meets the condition corresponding to its current color, as described below</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The radlight cap uses Radlight Spores.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Blue</strong> The radlight cap detects a sound louder than a whisper.</p></li><li><p><strong>Green</strong> A non-fungus creature within 30 feet ends their turn without having moved at least 5 feet.</p></li><li><p><strong>Red</strong> A non-fungus creature within 30 feet takes an attack, move, or manipulate action that the radlight cap can detect.</p></li><li><p><strong>Yellow</strong> A non-fungus creature within 30 feet ends their turn without being @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p></li></ul>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": []
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "nzAkCioBn4Ggjpqc",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Radlight Spores",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 3
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The radlight cap releases a cloud of spores in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:30]. The spores deal @Damage[2d10|options:area-damage,radlight-spores] damage (@Check[fortitude|dc:24|basic] save) to all non-fungus creatures in the area. The type of damage dealt and an additional effect is determined by the radlight cap's current color.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Blue</strong> The spores deal mental damage. Creatures that fail their save can't breathe or speak for 1 round.</p></li><li><p><strong>Green</strong> The spores deal force damage. Creatures that fail their save are pushed 10 feet away from the radlight cap.</p></li><li><p><strong>Red</strong> The spores deal fire damage. Creatures that fail their save are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed] for 1 round.</p></li><li><p><strong>Yellow</strong> The spores deal electricity damage. Creatures that fail their save are knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p></li></ul>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [
                    {
                        "key": "DamageAlteration",
                        "mode": "override",
